      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I strongly disagree. Having hitches every time someone joins the world or swaps avatars is a huge burden on everyone in the room.\n\nYou should be advocating for fixing the issue of animation overrides sticking instead of reverting a change that improves performance for everyone.\n\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrchat-now-hitches-when-an-avatar-is-loaded",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
