      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b6b4e8cb1b04a6db0be465d|full_name}: We see causing a frame hitch to compositor to all users level-wide as a much bigger problem as a slightly increased load time. We can (and will) revisit load times in future releases, but hitching is a straight-up bug that needs to be (and is) fixed.\n\nAnimation overrides is a seperate bug that needs to be addressed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
