  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not to mention you can't even use the mute player by default fix anymore to reset your face when it gets stuck on a gesture override. Sometimes it can take upwards of 10 seconds to change an avatar. If my face gets stuck that's 20 seconds of avatar changing back and forth just to fix it. I don't think this is a good fix for this issue, as I'd personally much rather have a loading screen for 1 second than having to wait 10 seconds to load in (or 20 seconds to switch back and forth). Ideally though I'd rather neither of those things.\n\nI think a new solution should be found because this one isn't very good.",
